<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43005" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scissūra</span></b> , ae, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				tearing</i>, <i>rending</i>, <i>dividing; a rent</i>, <i>cleft</i>, <i>scissure</i> (postAug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Sen. Q.
				N. 6, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad scissuram Nili,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					5, 9, 9, § 50</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 28, 34,
				§ 100</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sal rectis scissuris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					31, 7, 39, § 79</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pall. Mai, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Matt.
				9, 16</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domestica turbat rem populi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Psych. 756</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">audio scissuras esse inter vos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					1 Cor. 11, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
